@startuml
title <size:24>Component View: Swarm Platform - Board</size>\n<size:24>Board parts B1-B6 and the kernel guards: task store, kguard, flow config and engine, role router, spawn, board goal binding, validation and limits</size>

set separator none
left to right direction
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam nodesep 30
hide stereotype

